========================================================================
SUMMARY
========================================================================
Main result — InformedBottom raises perceived disagreement by ~3 pp — 
survives every robustness check: the point estimate stays in the 
0.022–0.033 range and the sign never flips. Permutation p-values confirm 
statistical significance. CRT effect also stable across cutoffs and 
functional forms.